@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade Infrastructure - Local Runtime Topology with Docker Compose

node "Developer machine / local environment" as Local {
  node "Docker Compose" as Compose EZ_DEVOPS {
    node "frontend service\neztrade-frontend" as FrontNode EZ_FRONTEND {
      component "Next.js dev server\nnpm run dev -- --hostname 0.0.0.0" as Next
      component "Port mapping\n${FRONTEND_PORT:-3000}:3000" as FrontPort
      component "NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL\nhttp://localhost:8088" as ApiEnv
      component "NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL\nws://localhost:8088/ws" as WsEnv
    }

    node "backend service\neztrade-backend" as BackNode EZ_BACKEND {
      component "Spring Boot app\nserver.port=8088" as Spring
      component "Port mapping\n${BACKEND_PORT:-8088}:8088" as BackPort
      component "JWT + CORS\nAPP_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS" as SecurityConfig
      component "Market cache\nTTL from MARKET_CACHE_TTL_SECONDS" as Cache
      component "Tomcat access logs\nlogs/access*.log" as AccessLogs
    }

    database "db service\neztrade-db\nmysql:8.4" as MySQL EZ_DB
  }
}

cloud "Alpha Vantage\nhttps://www.alphavantage.co/query" as Alpha EZ_EXTERNAL

Next --> Spring : REST + WebSocket\nlocalhost:8088 from browser
Spring --> MySQL : JDBC MySQL\njdbc:mysql://db:3306/EZTrade
Spring --> Alpha : HTTPS RestClient\nALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY
Spring --> AccessLogs : Tomcat access log
Spring --> Cache : Caffeine
Compose --> MySQL : named volume\neztrade_mysql_data

note bottom
Evidence: docker-compose.yml, backend/Dockerfile, frontend/Dockerfile,
.env.example, and application.properties. The repository defines a local
Docker Compose runtime; production deployment manifests or IaC were not found.
end note

@enduml
